diff --git a/CHANGELOG b/CHANGELOG
index 63076fa..1fdc585 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG
+++ b/CHANGELOG
@@ -15,6 +15,30 @@ Bug Fixes
 
 * Fix statement splitting (issue845).
 * Fix a late-binding closure bug in `TokenList.token_not_matching`.
+* CLI: don't truncate the input file (--in-place) or output file when
+  options are invalid or formatting fails; report decoding errors and
+  parse "--comma_first False" / "--compact False" correctly.
+* Fix AttributeError in `Function.get_window()` for functions without OVER.
+* `Function.get_parameters()` always returns a list and no longer drops
+  single operations, CASE expressions, wildcards, NULL or typed literals.
+* Window functions and ordered identifiers ("x DESC") no longer report
+  a bogus alias.
+* Functions are grouped in CREATE TABLE ... as SELECT (lowercase "as").
+* `truncate_strings` no longer produces broken literals for strings
+  containing escaped quotes.
+* Token types keep their identity when statements are copied or pickled.
+* `parsestream()` accepts binary and other non-TextIOBase file objects.
+* Long operator chains ("a || b || ...") no longer exceed the grouping
+  depth limit; chained operations are grouped into a single Operation.
+* Fix quadratic runtime when grouping long identifier lists.
+* Incomplete "x AS" / ":=" before punctuation no longer swallows the
+  closing parenthesis, which crashed reindenting.
+* Fix crash in aligned reindent for CASE without END.
+* Fix statement splitting at END REPEAT in procedures.
+* `split(strip_semicolon=True)` also strips semicolons followed by a comment.
+* `identifier_case` no longer changes backtick/bracket quoted identifiers.
+* Python/PHP output: escape backslashes (and "$" for PHP) and keep line
+  breaks inserted by reindent inside nested groups.
 
 
 Release 0.5.5 (Dec 19, 2025)
